cyclesim offline tooling

Original code and portable adaptations: knapcio, Apache-2.0.
Decode-cycle accounting, expert-union occupancy, residual closure and prefix
survival follow the earlier simulator versions. Graph segmentation, interval
union and ordinal rank wait follow the original offline profile analysis.
Profiler formats: PyTorch Kineto/CUPTI and vLLM counters. Packed-weight shape
context: IST-DASLab Marlin, Neural Magic and vLLM contributors. Collective
classification context: Luke Alonso, Jason Cook and Local Inference Lab.
No serving, scheduler, model weights, CUDA or profiler implementation is bundled.
